        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Craig\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/48/2150_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Craig:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We're also looking for volunteers at the booth! Half your time gets you a badge, a shirt, and time with some pretty neat people. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>When are you guys officially requesting for volunteers (like with a sign-up email)?</p>\n<p>Defeateddust and I would both enjoy being volunteers again at this GenCon.</p>",
